{"nodes": [{"id": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "label": "Informe de validaci\u00f3n Flink DR (HTML)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "concept_error_flink_dr_directorios_faltantes", "label": "FAIL cr\u00edtico \u2014 /data/flink y /var/log/flink no existen en nodos DR", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hallazgo de mayor severidad del informe DR: sin estos directorios Flink no tiene d\u00f3nde escribir checkpoints/savepoints/logs, por lo que un failover real partir\u00eda sin estado recuperable. FAIL consistente en los 3 nodos DR, sin interpretaci\u00f3n alternativa."}, {"id": "concept_error_redis_dr_inaccesible", "label": "WARN bloqueante \u2014 Redis DR inaccesible en :6379", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los dos jobs cr\u00edticos de contingencia (reconstrucci\u00f3n de saldos Kafka\u2192Flink\u2192Redis, y serving de \u00faltimos N movimientos) dependen de esta escritura; sin Redis el DR no cumple su prop\u00f3sito funcional aunque el resto de checks pase."}, {"id": "concept_error_ping_intermitente_proc01_cont", "label": "FAIL contradictorio \u2014 ping a pbigd-proc01-cont falla desde JM DR pese a API REST y logs locales mostrando el nodo activo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Apunta a bloqueo de ICMP o conectividad intermitente/asim\u00e9trica en el segmento DR, no a un nodo ca\u00eddo \u2014 el M\u00f3dulo 6 (REST API) confirma 2 TaskManagers registrados incluyendo ese nodo."}, {"id": "concept_error_grep_c_pipefail_bug", "label": "Bug en validate_flink_dr.sh \u2014 grep -c bajo set -euo pipefail rompe comparaci\u00f3n [[ \"$ERRORS\" -eq 0 ]]", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cuando grep -c no encuentra coincidencias sale con status 1 aunque ya imprimi\u00f3 \"0\"; el || echo 0 agrega una segunda l\u00ednea, y el resultado (\"0\\n0\") rompe la comparaci\u00f3n con 'syntax error in expression'. Defecto del script de validaci\u00f3n (l\u00edneas ~595-604), no de la infraestructura DR."}], "edges": [{"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "logs_flink_dr_pbigd_plat_apps01_cont_validate_flink_dr_run", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "logs_flink_dr_pbigd_proc01_cont_validate_flink_dr_run", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "logs_flink_dr_pbigd_proc02_cont_validate_flink_dr_run", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_flink_dr_directorios_faltantes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_redis_dr_inaccesible", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_kafka_dr_inaccesible", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_ping_intermitente_proc01_cont", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_systemd_segfault", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_error_grep_c_pipefail_bug", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_incidente_script_editado_en_vivo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_node_exporter_gap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "validacion_flink/informe_flink_dr.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "validacion_flink_informe_flink_dr", "target": "concept_minio_dr", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "